hadiths[17]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1329","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Sa'd Sa'idi (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Uwaimir Ajlani (Raziyallahu anhu) Aasim bin Adi Ansari (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas aae aur un se kaha: 'Aey Aasim! Tumhara kya khayal hai agar koi aadmi apni biwi ke sath kisi aadmi ko pae aur use qatl kar de to kya tum use qatl karoge? To woh kya kare? Aey Aasim! Mere liye Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se is masle ke bare mein poocho.' Jab Aasim (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se is ke bare mein poocha to Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne in sawalon ko napasand farmaya, aur jo Aap (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne is silsile mein farmaya woh Aasim (Raziyallahu anhu) par bhari guzra. Phir jab Aasim (Raziyallahu anhu) ghar wapas aae to Uwaimir (Raziyallahu anhu) in ke paas aae aur poocha: 'Aey Aasim! Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne tumhen kya jawab diya?' To Aasim (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Uwaimir (Raziyallahu anhu) se kaha: 'Tum mere paas koi bhalai nahin lae, Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us sawal ko napasand farmaya jo tum ne poocha tha.' Uwaimir ne kaha: 'Allah ki qasam! Main nahin rukunga yahan tak ke main Aap se is ke bare mein poochun.' To Uwaimir aae yahan tak ke logon ke darmiyan Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas pahunche aur kaha: 'Ya Rasulullah! Aap ka kya khayal hai us aadmi ke bare mein jo apni biwi ke sath kisi aadmi ko pae, kya woh use qatl kar de phir tum use qatl karoge, ya woh kya kare?' To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tumhare aur tumhari biwi ke bare mein Allah ne nazil farma diya hai. Jao aur use le aao.' Sahl bin Sa'd ne kaha: Phir un donon ne li'an kiya jabke main logon ke sath Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas tha. Jab woh donon li'an se farigh hue to Uwaimir ne kaha: Agar main use rok kar rakhun to main ne is par jhoot bandha hai, Ya Rasulullah! To us ne use teen talaqen din qabl is ke ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) use hukm dete. Ibn Shihab ne kaha: Yahi donon li'an karne walon ki sunnat thi."
"1330","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Sa'd (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Uwaimir Ajlani (Raziyallahu anhu) Aasim bin Adi (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas aae aur kaha: 'Aey Aasim! Mere liye Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se is masle ke bare mein poocho: Agar koi aadmi apni biwi ke sath kisi aadmi ko pae aur use qatl kar de to kya use is ke badle mein qatl kiya jaega? To woh kya kare?' To Aasim ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne in sawalon ko bura samjha. Phir Aasim (Raziyallahu anhu) Uwaimir (Raziyallahu anhu) se mile, aur us ne poocha: 'Tum ne kya kiya?' Unhon ne kaha: 'Main ne poocha, magar tumhari taraf se mujhe koi bhalai nahin pahunchi. Main ne Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha to unhon ne masle ko bura samjha.' Phir Uwaimir (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: 'Allah ki qasam! Main khud Allah ke Rasool (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas jaunga aur poochunga.' Woh aae, aur tab tak in donon ke bare mein Quran nazil ho chuka tha. To Aap ne in donon ko bulaya aur in ke darmiyan li'an karaya. Phir Uwaimir (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: 'Agar main use ab bhi rakhta hun to main ne is par jhoot bandha hai.' To us ne use talaq de di qabl is ke ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) use hukm dete. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Use dekho. Agar woh kala siyah moti aankhon wala bade sureen wala bacha jane to mere khayal mein woh sachcha hai. Aur agar woh surkh girgit jaisa bacha jane to mere khayal mein woh jhoota hai.' To us ne na-pasandeeda sifat wala bacha jana. Ibn Shihab ne kaha: Phir yahi donon li'an karne walon ki sunnat ho gai."
"1331","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Sa'd (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Uwaimir (Raziyallahu anhu) Aasim (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas aae aur kaha: 'Koi aadmi apni biwi ke sath kisi aadmi ko pae aur use qatl kar de, phir kya tum use qisas mein qatl karoge? To woh aadmi kya kare? Aey Aasim! Mere liye Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se yeh sawal poocho.' Unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne masle ko napasand farmaya aur narazgi ka izhar farmaya. Aasim (Raziyallahu anhu) Uwaimir (Raziyallahu anhu) ke paas aae aur unhen bataya ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne masle ko napasand farmaya aur narazgi ka izhar farmaya. To Uwaimir ne kaha: 'Allah ki qasam! Main khud Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas jaunga.' Woh aae, aur Aasim (Raziyallahu anhu) ke jaane ke baad Quran nazil ho chuka tha. Woh aae aur unhon ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocha. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Tumhare bare mein Quran nazil ho chuka hai.' Phir in donon ne aage badh kar li'an kiya. Phir Uwaimir (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: 'Agar main use ab bhi rok kar rakhun to main ne is par jhoot bandha hai.' To us ne use talaq de di aur Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne use hukm na diya tha. To donon li'an karne walon ki sunnat jari ho gai. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Use dekho. Agar woh surkh chhota girgit jaisa bacha jane to mere khayal mein us ne is par jhoot bandha hai. Aur agar woh siyah moti aankhon wala bade sureen wala bacha jane to mere khayal mein woh is par sachcha hai. To us ne na-pasandeeda sifat wala bacha jana."
"1332","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Musayyab aur Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin Utbah se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Agar woh gora seedhe baalon wala bacha jane to woh is ke shauhar ka hai, aur agar woh kala siyah bacha jane to woh us ka hai jis par ilzam lagaya gaya.' Unhon ne kaha: Phir us ne kala siyah bacha jana."
"1333","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Sa'd jo Banu Sa'idah ke bhai hain, se riwayat hai ke Ansar ka ek aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: 'Ya Rasulullah! Aap ka kya khayal hai us aadmi ke bare mein jo apni biwi ke sath kisi aadmi ko pae, kya woh use qatl kar de phir tum use qatl karoge, ya woh kya kare?' To Allah Azza wa Jalla ne is ke bare mein woh nazil farmaya jo Quran mein donon li'an karne walon ke muamle ke bare mein mazkoor hai. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tumhare aur tumhari biwi ke bare mein faisla ho chuka hai.' Unhon ne kaha: Phir un donon ne li'an kiya aur main hazir tha. Phir us ne use Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas talaq de di. Phir in donon ke baad sunnat ho gai ke donon li'an karne walon ke darmiyan judai kar di jae. Woh haamla thi to us ne is ka inkar kiya. To is ke bete ko is ki maa ki taraf mansoob kiya gaya."
"1334","[AI-translation] Qasim bin Muhammad se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Ibn Abbas ke paas hazir tha jab woh donon li'an karne walon ki hadees bayan kar rahe the. To Ibn Shaddad ne un se kaha: 'Kya yahi woh aurat hai jis ke bare mein Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar main kisi ko baghair saboot ke rajm karta to ise rajm karta?' To Ibn Abbas ne farmaya: 'Nahin, woh woh aurat thi jo khullam khulla karti thi.'"
"1335","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Sa'd (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, aur unhon ne donon li'an karne walon ki hadees zikr ki. Unhon ne kaha: Phir Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Use dekho. Agar woh siyah moti aankhon wali bade sureen wali bachi jane to mere khayal mein woh sachcha hai. Aur agar woh surkh girgit jaisi bachi jane to mere khayal mein woh jhoota hai. Phir us ne na-pasandeeda sifat wali bachi jani.'"
"1336","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Musayyab aur Ubaidullah bin Abdullah se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Agar woh surkh seedhe baalon wala bacha jane to woh is ke shauhar ka hai, aur agar woh kala ghungrale baalon wala bacha jane to woh us ka hai jis par ilzam lagaya gaya.' Phir us ne kala bacha jana."
"1337","[AI-translation] Hisham bin Urwah se riwayat hai ke Uwaimir Ajlani Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aae, jabke woh surkh seedhe baalon wale kamzor jism wale the. To unhon ne kaha: 'Ya Rasulullah! Sharik bin Sahma' ke bare mein aap ka kya khayal hai, yani apne chacha ke bete ke bare mein, woh bade sureen wala, moti aankhon wala, bure jism wala hai, woh falan aurat se, yani meri biwi se sohbat karta hai, jabke woh haamla hai. Aur main falan waqt se is ke qareeb nahin gaya.' To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Sharik ko bulaya to us ne inkar kar diya, aur aurat ko bulaya to us ne inkar kar diya. To Aap ne is aur is ke shauhar ke darmiyan li'an karaya jabke woh haamla thi. Phir farmaya: 'Use dekho. Agar woh moti aankhon wala bade sureen wala bacha jane to mere khayal mein woh is par sachcha hai. Aur agar woh surkh girgit jaisa bacha jane to mere khayal mein woh is par jhoota hai.' Phir us ne moti aankhon wala bade sureen wala bacha jana. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne us bare mein jo hamen pahuncha farmaya: 'Beshak is ka muamla wazeh hai agar Allah ke faisle ke siwa hota,' yani ke woh us ka hai jis ne zina kiya agar Allah ke faisle ke siwa hota ke kisi par faisla nahin hota siwae iqrar ya apne nafs par etiraf ke, in donon mein se ek ke siwa daleel se halal nahin agarche wazeh ho. To agar Allah ke faisle ke siwa hota to main is mein aur faisla karta. Aur Aap ne na Sharik ko chheda aur na aurat ko. Wallahu a'lam. Aur Aap ne hukm nafiz kiya jabke Aap jante the ke in donon mein se ek jhoota hai. Phir baad mein maloom hua ke shauhar sachcha hai."
"1338","[AI-translation] Qasim bin Muhammad se, Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke ek aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: 'Ya Rasulullah! Allah ki qasam! Khajooron ki ifar ke baad se mera apne ghar walon se koi talluq nahin hai.' Ibn Abbas ne kaha: 'Ifar yeh hai ke jab khajoor ki piwandkari ki jae to chalis din use pani na diya jae.' Us ne kaha: 'Aur main ne apni biwi ke sath ek aadmi ko paya hai.' Unhon ne kaha: Aur is ka shauhar zard patli pindliyon wala seedhe baalon wala tha, jabke jis par ilzam lagaya gaya woh bhara hua siyah ghungrale sakht ghungrale baalon wala tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Aey Allah! Wazeh farma.' Phir in donon ke darmiyan li'an karaya. To us ne aise aadmi ko jana jo us se mushtabeh tha jis par ilzam lagaya gaya tha."
"1339","[AI-translation] Aasim bin Kulaib se, apne walid se, Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne jab donon li'an karne walon ke darmiyan li'an karaya to ek aadmi ko hukm diya ke woh paanchwin martaba is ke munh par hath rakhe, aur farmaya: 'Beshak yahi wajib karne wali hai.'"
"1340","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Sa'd (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas donon li'an karne walon ko dekha jabke main pandrah saal ka tha. Phir unhon ne lambi hadees bayan ki, magar use un jaise yaad na rakha."
"1341","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne donon li'an karne walon ke darmiyan judai kar di aur bachche ko aurat se mila diya."
"1342","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein ek aadmi ne apni biwi se li'an kiya aur phir is ke bachche se inkar kiya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne in donon ke darmiyan judai kar di aur bachche ko aurat se mila diya."
"1343","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Jubair se, Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne donon li'an karne walon se farmaya: 'Tum donon ka hisab Allah par hai. Tum mein se ek jhoota hai. Tumhen is par koi rasta nahin.' Us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mera maal? Aap ne farmaya: 'Tumhare liye koi maal nahin. Agar tum is par sachche ho to woh is ke badle mein hai jo tum ne is ki sharmgah ko halal kiya. Aur agar tum is par jhoote ho to woh tumhen is se aur door karne wala hai.'"
"1344","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Umar ko kahte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Banu Ajlan ke donon bhaiyon ke darmiyan judai kar di. Aur Aap ne is tarah apni donon ungliyon shahadat aur darmiyani se ishara kiya phir in donon ko darmiyani aur is ke baad wali yani shahadat se juda kiya. Aur farmaya: 'Allah janta hai ke tum mein se ek jhoota hai, to kya tum mein se koi tauba karne wala hai?'"
"1345","[AI-translation] Maqburi Qurazi ko hadees bayan karte the. Maqburi ne kaha: Mujhe Abu Hurairah ne bayan kiya: Beshak unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna jab li'an ki aayat nazil hui to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jo aurat kisi qaum mein use dakhil kare jo in mein se nahin to woh Allah ki taraf se kuch nahin aur Allah use Apni Jannat mein dakhil nahin karega. Aur jo aadmi apne bete ka inkar kare jabke woh use dekh raha ho to Allah Ta'ala is se hijab karega aur use awwaleen wa aakhireen mein makhlooq ke samne ruswa karega.'"
